  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the 5'6\" bed of 2017 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 Nissan Titan without Titan Box. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2017-2024 Nissan Titan fleetside 5.5 ft bed\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nPrecisely Fit: reliable manufacturer brand packaging; Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the 5'6\" bed of 2017 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 Nissan Titan without Titan Box.\nEasy Installation: No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with adjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user friendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly.\nSafety First: Reinforced corner design keeps the cover tight to the bed; sturdy clamps and buckles with straps protect the cover from sliding or blowing off while driving.\nGreat Quality: Made with double layer PVC on the top, structured with solid alloy in the frame, this back cover is build to last for your truck.\nAll season Protection: Features tear resistant, water resistance, high temperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is like, we’ve got you covered.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.",
